// ModelDisplayName :
"P544945687" "Dr. Nova"
// Description :
"P568800489" "Find Dr. Nova"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P618424507" "I'll tell you everything, and by that act slip free of the chains of karma!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P768532188" "You learned what Longbow was after."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3592434195" "At a guess, I'd say that Longbow is trying to break Bane spider conditioning using Dr. Nova's device. I think Gally is trying to bring her boyfriend back. How adorable. But what Dr. Nova said about 'emotional triggers' and change sweeping like wildfire worry me greatly. And unfortunately, we still have to keep Arachnos from knowing about this, lest they know about our part in all this. We just have to figure out what their next move is."
// RandomFameString :
"P3886739548" "Have you seen Bane Spiders acting weird, or is it just me?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2749932365" "There have been many reports of Bane Spiders acting very strangely. Congregating away from Arachnos bases, even attacking other Arachnos soldiers. One of the vagrants who frequents Haven House saw a squad of Fortunata's going to confront some of them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think we need to make ourselves part of this situation.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1868481019" "Find out what's happening to the Bane Spiders"
// SendOffString :
"P3251585938" "There have only been a few reports of strange activity so far, but it has me rather worried. See if you can find any of the Fortunatas who were sent in to break up the Bane Spider meeting. Oh, and if there is a particular Bane Spider leading them, eliminate him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2864317266" "Break up Bane Spider gathering"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3343957826" "You have to wonder why anyone would bother to gather down here."

